<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Furniture and fixtures</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis-FurnitureAndFixturesMember_RangeAxis-MinimumMember" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" id="c141961428" format="ixt-sec:duryear">3</ix:nonNumeric> - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis-FurnitureAndFixturesMember_RangeAxis-MaximumMember" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" id="c141961429" format="ixt-sec:duryear">5</ix:nonNumeric></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We recorded depreciation expense of approximat<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ely $<ix:nonFraction id="c141962220" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">9.6</ix:nonFraction> million and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141962221" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">8.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million respectively, for the years ended </span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">.</span></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
