   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <div style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">
     We act&#160;as&#160;sublessor&#160;in certain leasing arrangements, primarily related to&#160;land and buildings. &#160;Fixed sublease payments received are recognized on a straight-line basis over the sublease term. Sublease income and head lease expense for these transactions are recognized on net basis on the consolidated financial statements. Sublease income is recorded within the Selling, general, and administrative expenses&#160;section of the Consolidated Statements of Operations and Comprehensive Loss.
   </div>
   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
