  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="amtx:OutstandingWarrantsTextBlock" id="c3134950" escape="true">
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">9.</em> Warrants to Purchase Common Stock</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">During <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, Aemetis, Inc. issued warrants to <em style="font: inherit;">two</em> lenders exercisable for the purchase of <ix:nonFraction id="c141962466" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-WarrantsInConnectionWithSubordinatedNotesMember_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis-AAFKMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">339,999</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141962467" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-WarrantsInConnectionWithSubordinatedNotesMember_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis-AAFKMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per share with a term of <em style="font: inherit;">two</em> years in connection with extensions of the lenders' notes. Some of these warrants were exercised within <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>&#160;with a combination of cashless exercise and cash payments.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The following table summarizes warrant activity for the years ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>:</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfStockholdersEquityNoteWarrantsOrRightsTextBlock" id="c3134951" escape="true">
