     <div style="font-variant: normal; text-align: justify;">
       For the years ended
      <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, we recorded stock-based compensation&#160;expense in the amount of
      <span style="background-color:#ffffff">$<ix:nonFraction id="c141962514" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">5.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141962515" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">8.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively. </span>As of
      <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, we had $
      <ix:nonFraction id="c141962516" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">3.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of total unrecognized compensation expense for option issuance that we will amortize over the remaining vesting period of each individual option grant.&#160;The outstanding unvested options have a remaining weighted average vesting term of
      <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="c141962517" format="ixt-sec:duryear">1.7</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years.
     </div>
