   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The table below provides the updated requirements of ASU <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">09</em> for our effective tax rate for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>.&#160;</p>
   <p style="text-indent: -9pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
