   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As previously disclosed, our income tax benefit for the year ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024</em>, prior to the adoption of ASU <em style="font: inherit;">2023</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">09,</em> differs from the amounts computed by applying the statutory U.S. federal income tax rate (<em style="font: inherit;">21%</em>) to loss before income taxes as a result of the following:</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
